                  <nc xml:id="m-fe6e8bdb-d828-448d-b75f-a699f996b0a7" pname="b" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-e59bb7f4-6b59-4fa6-97b9-980281b2644b" pname="a" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-64cf21fd-0c79-4688-b535-e2d297d5b778" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-264427a8-c444-4221-8913-470e46fd1373" facs="#m-5aa3c17c-4e3e-470a-acf0-af04832d6a30" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-692c19d2-cc88-4b46-aa05-bbed3064cb2b"><lg xml:id="m-2cd1e98b-16fb-4263-ae5e-44f1971a5f5a"><l xml:id="m-5a828825-f6cc-4c34-bb11-fee0cb656176" facs="#m-d6b76126-642a-4c69-881f-9ee137b54441" label="ambiguous">November I.</l><l xml:id="m-436233df-1144-4e34-aeab-23ea1475f722" facs="#m-d683bc18-9a90-4a3d-87c9-f22f939eed7c" label="ambiguous">1731</l><l xml:id="m-d98a59a6-59cb-48f5-8d09-a765f3b53f0a" facs="#m-8eb61021-f206-4631-a39a-2dd02df68e28" label="lyrics-like">Confes-si-ó-nis, éxsu-les Vocá-te nos in pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4d4d3c7-462a-423f-a222-b906dbd125a8" facs="#m-03689a2d-1660-43c8-b022-ab2a940035c0" label="ambiguous">mi-o</l><l xml:id="m-795a3f6e-e151-4799-8956-a44a4f1220f0" facs="#m-d43255c2-1a7a-4916-a013-52306b03e618" label="lyrics-like">tri-am. 5. Cho- ré-a cásta Vírginum, Et quos e-rémus ín¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9ccbee0-e58f-4b1b-995f-b530a0745996" facs="#m-3039aa71-801d-41d9-bd1a-9af5e8c0bd86" label="lyrics-like">co-las Transmí-sit ástris, caéli-tum Locá- te nos in sé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f132dc2e-887a-4bce-b4de-181ce84ea2de" facs="#m-2fe2de18-8e6f-4e72-a45e-e8037d530fdd" label="lyrics-like">dibus. 6. Au-férte géntem pér-fidam Credén-ti-um de fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a5ffa59-9e36-4080-90be-612643692b70" facs="#m-af025e4a-e1ad-4de5-9347-020d8155c9b7" label="ambiguous">ni-bus,</l><l xml:id="m-5cb72438-b94a-4981-904f-d2f0cf0ecf6d" facs="#m-8aa8403e-f99e-4c4d-bf09-d8d3be14f716" label="lyrics-like">Ut ú-nus ómnes úni-cum Oví- le nos pástor</l><l xml:id="m-1e3e55bf-fa9a-42b0-9c16-fd71a74e5143" facs="#m-71d6646a-78fc-4f40-9acc-b8fbece1eecb" label="lyrics-like">régat. 7. Dé- o Pátri sit gló-ri-a, Na-tóque Pátris ú-ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec68efc4-cc00-440d-8a0f-e37976cd7172" facs="#m-ec6901f9-c265-408f-a004-4c54b85e073e" label="lyrics-like">In sempi-térna saécu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1c1ca67-22da-4056-bec0-cf6b73a7f3d9" facs="#m-cfdbbeac-3f3a-4215-8cc4-bed463183ec7" label="lyrics-like">co, Sáncto simul Pa-rácli-to,</l><l xml:id="m-03b3f29e-f3bd-4180-9a4c-abb60b1d08eb" facs="#m-870bafd4-ece1-4a13-979c-fcdda9e2b911" label="ambiguous">la. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-dc968da7-9b11-4dde-a045-db1cce2d51d7" facs="#m-3adf319b-0eca-4150-95b3-feea7650317f" label="lyrics-like">V. Exsultábunt Sáncti</l><l xml:id="m-96f2d947-b8a8-43d4-9a1c-a1821a39e095" facs="#m-3ab3bb19-9a12-4330-8869-ecce8a429c39" label="lyrics-like">in gló-ri-a.</l><l xml:id="m-7469b6b1-7f7d-4abe-af44-f27dfe882b40" facs="#m-d4a76478-f0ed-4f24-bf1f-ea290afa10dd" label="lyrics-like">R. Laetabúntur in cubí-libus sú-is.</l><l xml:id="m-ce06062d-9b85-409c-8497-74bb23d6f226" facs="#m-f8a8e3c7-b475-4082-9e13-7e49e67be39a" label="text-like">(This tone for the Y. and R. is used only on the Feast itself.)</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
